# Yavimaya, Cradle of Growth: "Each land is a Forest in addition to its other land types."
#
# The Plains keeps its own type and gains Forest (CR 305.7: a land that gains a land type in addition to its own keeps
# its types and rules text), and the {T}: Add {G} comes from the Forest subtype (CR 305.6) rather than from anything
# Yavimaya prints.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Yavimaya, Cradle of Growth
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Subtypes = Plains
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Yavimaya, Cradle of Growth.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate(Ability: {T}: Add {G}.)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Subtypes = Forest; Plains
Bot1.Mana = {G}
